WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 10.7 · Legal, Compliance, Policies & Risk
Whistleblowing, complaints and incident reporting

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Give people safe, visible routes to report concerns, including about leaders.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Separate whistleblowing, complaints and incidents; name who receives each.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Always offer a route around the most senior person.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. List what must be reported outside, and how fast.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Riverside Repair Hub (Hybrid · charity with a trading company, United Kingdom)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Riverside: concerns about the director go to the chair; complaints answered in 20 days; one incident form for all incidents.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You create reporting channels, timescales and outside reporting duties.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
